<title>USA: US Treasury's Rubin to testify on budget Tuesday.</title>
<headline>US Treasury's Rubin to testify on budget Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury Secretary Robert Rubin will testify as scheduled on Tuesday on the Clinton administration's budget proposals before the House Ways and Means Committee, a department official said.</p>
<p>Rubin, who canceled an appearance before the Senate budget committee on Monday because he was ill, is scheduled to testify at 1300 EST/1800 GMT before the House tax-writing committee.</p>
<p>No new date has yet been set for his Senate testimony, a committee official said.</p>
